{
  "_comment": "CTF flags per Test-games/<slug>: an asset a reverse engineer wants from that game. A flag passes when the extraction workspace holds at least `min` files matching `glob` (relative to the workspace, ** allowed), or when the run's warnings contain `warning`. tools/integration_games.py evaluates them; sqc/17-ctf.md lists them for people.",
